OL,3,GNEWSACommunity support important after
OL,4,AHalloween stabbings, say police
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have said it is important people
OL,7,Fin the community "continue to support
OL,8,Fone another" after five teenagers were
OL,9,Fstabbed at a Halloween party.
OL,11,FOfficers were called shortly after
OL,12,F22:30 GMT on Saturday to a home in Park
OL,13,FRoad in Chandler's Ford where an
OL,14,F"unknown group" had gained entry to the
OL,15,Fevent over a garden fence.
OL,17,FOne boy, 17, remains in hospital in a
OL,18,Fserious condition and four others, who
OL,19,Fwere injured, have since been
OL,20,Fdischarged. Six arrests have been made.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
