OL,3,GNEWSACommunity support important after
OL,4,AHalloween stabbings, say police
OL,5,
OL,6,FCh Insp Rachel Noble said she
OL,7,Frecognised incidents of this nature
OL,8,Fwere "deeply distressing", adding: "It
OL,9,Fis important that we continue to
OL,10,Fsupport one another and ensure that
OL,11,Fanyone who needs help knows where to
OL,12,Ffind it."
